@startuml
title 02 - Auth (Overview)
autonumber

actor "Frontend / Postman" as FE
participant "Gateway :8099" as GW
participant "Auth Service :8091" as AUTH
database "Auth DB" as ADB
collections "SMTP" as SMTP

group Auth Summary
  FE -> GW: 1) Login (/api/v1/auth/login)
  GW -> AUTH: Forward
  AUTH -> ADB: Validate credentials + issue tokens
  AUTH --> FE: LoginData

  FE -> GW: 2) Forgot password (/api/v1/auth/forgot-password)
  GW -> AUTH: Forward
  AUTH -> ADB: Save OTP
  AUTH -> SMTP: Send OTP email
  AUTH --> FE: Generic success

  FE -> GW: 3) Verify OTP (/api/v1/auth/verify-reset-otp)
  GW -> AUTH: Forward
  AUTH -> ADB: Validate OTP + issue resetToken
  AUTH --> FE: resetToken

  FE -> GW: 4) Reset password (/api/v1/auth/reset-password)
  GW -> AUTH: Forward
  AUTH -> ADB: Validate resetToken + update password
  AUTH --> FE: Success

  FE -> GW: 5) Change password (/api/v1/auth/change-password)
  GW -> AUTH: Forward
  AUTH -> ADB: Validate current password + update password
  AUTH --> FE: Success
end

note over FE
Detailed split diagrams:
- 02a-auth-login.puml
- 02b-auth-forgot-password.puml
- 02c-auth-verify-reset-otp.puml
- 02d-auth-reset-password.puml
- 02e-auth-change-password.puml
end note

@enduml
